                  "historicalPurpose": "To return the first close-up photographs and telemetry from Mars.",
                  "howItWorked": "Launched atop Molniya rockets and stabilized using sun-star sensors with pressurized instrument compartments.",
                  "whyItMattered": "Pioneered interplanetary trajectory design despite early communications system failures in deep space.",
                  "id": "mars-ch1-sc3",
